ork, so the value in the 3PC table are set to 0. This means that we return a model with parameter set to 0 to the user. 
But most of the time the fit of the `SuperExpCutoffPowerLaw4FGLDR3SpectralModel` with `index_2` fixed at 2/3 worked and we can use it instead. 

